# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal-only: kept on disk for us, NOT shipped in the public repo.
# Remove a line here and `git add -f` the file to publish it again.
# Rationale: internal process, owner decisions and compute-budget bookkeeping
# add nothing for a reader of the public repo, and some name the owner's
# compute allowance explicitly. The scientific record (hypotheses, plan,
# upstream map, related work, gate reports) stays tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

docs/OPEN_QUESTIONS.md        # owner decisions, budget/CU, watch tripwires
docs/FINDINGS.md              # internal findings log
docs/MONITORING.md            # standing-watch agent protocol
docs/CUT_CELLS.md            # internal compute budget registry
docs/PUBLICATION_STAGES.md    # (already listed above)

docs/reports/STATUS-*.md      # internal status snapshots
docs/reports/REVIEW-*.md      # internal review notes
docs/reports/WATCH/           # literature-surveillance working notes
docs/plans/                   # superseded/internal planning
docs/specs/                   # internal engineering specs
